      "updated_at": "2017-06-20T14:19:01Z",
      "body": "Ya, that's a good idea to have analytics (anonymous & untraceable). We can indeed record events such as org creation/joining anonymously.\r\n\r\nWe have;\r\n1 . NeutrinoMetrics looking good but it is in an early stage. (https://neutrinometrics.net/)\r\n2. Evergreen Google Analytics https://www.npmjs.com/package/electron-google-analytics\r\n\r\nLet's discuss events types which are better for analytics.",
